WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:05.979
OK, I'm here to tell you that a Fox News propagandist
was right about something, but I am not telling

00:00:05.979 --> 00:00:10.010
you this to suggest that this is a good person
overall.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:16.770
I'm merely telling you every once in a while
the right does something so depraved that

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:22.490
even the worst of the worst right wing clown
propagandists say this is too much for me

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:23.980
and it's a bad idea.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:26.199
And I'm talking about Fox News host Sean HANNITY.

00:00:26.199 --> 00:00:31.160
Sean HANNITY came out against the outrageous
armed protesters who have been showing up

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:37.079
with long guns and handguns, demanding states,
open businesses and stop the corona virus,

00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:41.890
public health measures that actual doctors
and public health officials have determined

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:43.249
are necessary.

00:00:43.249 --> 00:00:45.640
Let's take a look at the clip from Hannity's
program.

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:46.749
Down Policies Michigan.

00:00:46.749 --> 00:00:49.989
I don't like this part in Michigan.

00:00:49.989 --> 00:00:54.889
The number one supporter and radio and television
that I know of, First Amendment and the Second

00:00:54.889 --> 00:00:55.889
Amendment.

00:00:55.889 --> 00:01:00.039
Now, no one is a bigger defender of the Second
Amendment than yours truly.

00:01:00.039 --> 00:01:05.070
Everyone has the right to protest, protect
themselves and try to get the country open.

00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:07.210
This with the militia.

00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:08.280
Look here.

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:13.409
And these long guns are no show of force is
dangerous.

00:01:13.409 --> 00:01:14.770
That puts our police at risk.

00:01:14.770 --> 00:01:17.240
And by the way, your message will never be
heard.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:23.000
Whoever you people are, no one should be attempting
to intimidate officials with a show of force.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:24.100
And God forbid something happens.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:27.790
Then they're going to go after all of us law
abiding Second Amendment people.

00:01:27.790 --> 00:01:31.100
I've been carrying a carry permit my whole
life.

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:32.100
All right.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:33.100
So he's right.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:38.280
I mean, these armed protesters are outrageous
and it's dangerous and it's a bad idea.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:44.180
And HANNITY has sort of stumbled across the
right position the way a drunken guy at a

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:51.380
bar sometimes stumbles back to their car before
driving drunk and crashing the vehicle.

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:56.749
HANNITY also has personal reasons, like he
doesn't want the focus being on his guns,

00:01:56.749 --> 00:02:01.649
which he thinks it might be if these nuts
keep showing up with rifles to state capitals

00:02:01.649 --> 00:02:02.649
around the country.

00:02:02.649 --> 00:02:05.469
And actor John Cusack actually made a similar
analogy.

00:02:05.469 --> 00:02:11.330
He tweeted, quote, Now, not interesting, like
a blackout drunk, slurring an apology after

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.540
he crashed into innocent people.

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:17.900
He's a deranged pathological liar, enabler
for a death cult.

00:02:17.900 --> 00:02:21.680
Nothing, he says, has any adult human value.

00:02:21.680 --> 00:02:26.900
Now, I generally agree, but I think that there
is some value here.

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:33.000
One reason that this is more than just a broken
clock being right once or twice a day is we

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.740
know HANNITY has a huge real-world influence
on his audience.

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:43.150
A couple weeks ago, we found a we saw a study
that found that people who watch HANNITY as

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:49.250
a primary news source over Tucker Carlson
and other Fox News host, the HANNITY watchers

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:54.710
are more likely to have gotten coronavirus
realistically because HANNITY was more against

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:58.100
the lockdowns and downplayed the seriousness
of the virus.

00:02:58.100 --> 00:03:04.420
Earlier on, his viewers saw that and were
encouraged to participate in riskier behavior,

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:06.600
which made them more likely to catch the virus.

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:09.130
So this actually does affect people.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:15.301
And the point is that this is something when
you think about the role that Sean HANNITY

00:03:15.301 --> 00:03:21.110
has for his audience, he's seen as like a
demigod by many of his viewers.

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:26.240
And if he says the armed protesters don't
make sense, this is too much, doesn't make

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:29.940
him a good person, doesn't make him right
about anything else that he said.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:34.220
But it actually might mean someone, one of
his viewers decides not to show up with a

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:35.340
long gun.

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:36.550
And we're all better off for it.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:38.550
We're all better off in every sense.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:40.210
But let me step back for a second.

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:42.630
I'm going to be perfectly frank with you here.

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:49.020
I actually share Sean Hannity's frustration
with the protesters, but I also share the

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:51.760
frustration of the protesters.

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:53.320
I don't own guns.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:54.730
I'm not showing up to protest.

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:58.850
And I don't think that the governors are the
people we should be protesting.

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:04.840
But I am outraged and frustrated and saddened
that what we've been doing hasn't worked because

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:11.170
there's been no proper federal coordination
of a functional national plan to deal with

00:04:11.170 --> 00:04:12.170
the virus.

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:18.630
So I'm with the protesters in that I believe
what we've done has been worse for the economy

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:20.350
than it had to be.

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:22.600
But we don't want to blame the governors for
that.

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.950
We need to be blaming Donald Trump's administration.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:28.580
The process should have been on day one of
a confirmed case.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:29.720
That was January 20.

00:04:29.720 --> 00:04:35.240
The Trump administration should have immediately
developed a working test like South Korea

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:36.240
did.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:41.910
It wouldn't be reasonable to expect that Trump
would shut things down when we had like 15

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:42.910
cases.

00:04:42.910 --> 00:04:49.480
But remember that March 5th, we already had
221 cases in the United States on March 5th.

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:55.700
Trump should have come out and said, let's
do a coordinated 50 state shutdown.

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:57.800
What we saw then happening in China.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:04:59.600
Remember March 5, China?

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:04.250
Eighty thousand cases and we had 200 that
should have been enough.

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:10.590
When you look at Italy on March 5th, Italy
already had 4000 cases on March 5th.

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:15.230
So we knew how quickly it could spread in
other countries as well.

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:18.420
If on March 5, Trump had said, we're shutting
it down.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.590
I need all 50 governors to do this with me.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:24.180
We're gonna do this for you know, we wouldn't
have known at the time how long.

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:26.460
But today is May 5th, right?

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:30.650
We would be 60 days in to a federally coordinated
shutdown.

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:33.210
The spread would have been cut dramatically.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:38.970
We wouldn't now have New York and Massachusetts
going down while Georgia, Florida and Texas

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:39.970
are exploding.

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:40.970
Right.

00:05:40.970 --> 00:05:45.710
We could actually have coordinated this from
the top and really be looking at reopening

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:46.710
now.

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:51.190
Instead, we're in a situation where CDC and
FEMA believe we might be at three thousand

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:53.650
deaths a day by June 1st.

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:55.240
Italy's cases are way down.

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:56.890
Spain's cases are way down.

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:57.890
France's are way down.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:02.320
South Korea, you know, they've managed to
keep this to a couple of hundred deaths total

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:05.160
and we still have one to two thousand deaths
a day.

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:08.350
And states are opening prematurely and cases
are spiking.

00:06:08.350 --> 00:06:10.410
So my point is this.

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:16.350
If you want me to join the protesters in saying
this was mishandled, this didn't need to be

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:18.530
this bad for the economy.

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:20.060
I'm right there with you.

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:22.889
But protesting governors with guns is not
the right answer.

00:06:22.889 --> 00:06:25.500
The right answer is hold the people accountable.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:26.500
Who did the wrong thing?

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:29.150
The federal coordination failed us.

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:33.760
Those who should be held accountable are in
Washington, DC.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:37.840
And of course, there are governors also acting
irresponsibly by wildly opening up or never

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:38.970
closing.

00:06:38.970 --> 00:08:03.390
Let's hold them accountable now and let's
hold them accountable in November as well.

